        "Title": "Banker",
        "Location": "LOCATION_MIAMI",
        "PublicId": "111775669099",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository bc7ca5bb-5338-4242-8e65-8562ab521bd6).Image",
        "Description": "Antoine Mack is a famous banker who built his career on &quot;helping&quot; with housing arrangements for his wealthy clients. One of them is our customer and he found out that Mack was stealing part of the money from his scheme, transferring it to offshore companies in the Isle of Man, Luxembourg and Bermuda. He also sells information about new developments by Kronstadt Industries. And right now he is in his office on the top floor of their Miami office. Don&apos;t miss this chance 47",
